nge vote to Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: Agent 2's tentative confidence in B due to lack of decision-quality evidence. We'll say that given C's explicit decision-quality and reliability, we now favor C.\n\nProvide evidence: C makes correct decisions quickly, keeps calm in crisis, 100% reliable. Also note concerns: difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education, which affect crew cooperation and adaptability. But we argue that these can be mitigated, and overall C's safety-critical strengths are stronger.\n\nThus vote for Candidate C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
