tribution, referencing discussion, using explicit facts, and include vote.\n\nWe can say: I agree with Agent 1's shift to Candidate C, but I still have concerns about crew cooperation and adaptability, and ask Agent 2 for any evidence on C's crew cooperation. However we need to ask via tool, not in public message. Could do a tool call to get more info. But the instruction says we need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON. We could also include a tool call before that if needed. But we already have enough evidence to support C. We can just reaffirm.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I continue to support Candidate C...\" referencing Agent 1 and Agent 3's earlier points. Provide evidence: decision quality, calmness, reliability. Mention concerns but mitigable. Vote Candidate C.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_3\",\"vote\":\"Candidate C\"}\n\nProceed."}
